+- **Index Out of Bounds**: The internal neighbor checks must be bounded by the array length (4096) [S1, unofficial]. The source code contains off-by-one errors in the internal West and Top checks (`i + 15` and `i + 255`); these are corrected to `i + 16` and `i + 256` in the pseudocode [S1, unofficial].
